# CLAUDE.md: results/ holds raw outputs — gitignored except summaries
results/*
!results/*.md
!results/summaries/

.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Wikidata is ingested into dated snapshots under data/wikidata/<date>/ —
# those ARE committed. Nothing here should be an ad-hoc cache.

# Run logs ARE kept — they record what executed, which a results file does not.
# Listed explicitly so a future results/ rule cannot swallow them.
!logs/
!logs/*.log
